## 📡 API Contract

### Assumption: Integration Agent Provides These Endpoints

#### **Endpoint 1: Add to Cart**

```
POST /api/hcl/cart/add
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: (handled by Integration Agent)

REQUEST:
{
  "partNumber": "CLA022_220601",    // from ACO/product catalog
  "quantity": 1,
  "productName": "Product Name"     // optional, for display
}

RESPONSE (Success - 200):
{
  "success": true,
  "orderId": "764426",
  "orderItem": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "6560045",
      "partNumber": "CLA022_220601",
      "quantity": "1",
      "unitPrice": "45.00000",
      "orderItemPrice": "45.00000",
      "orderItemInventoryStatus": "Available"
    }
  ],
  "cartTotals": {
    "itemCount": 1,
    "subtotal": "45.00000",
    "shippingCharge": "0.00000",
    "salesTax": "0.00000",
    "grandTotal": "45.00000",
    "currency": "USD"
  }
}

RESPONSE (Error - 400/404):
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "OUT_OF_STOCK" | "PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND" | "INVALID_QUANTITY",
  "message": "User-friendly error message",
  "productId": "CLA022_220601"
}
```

#### **Endpoint 2: Get Cart**

```
GET /api/hcl/cart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: (handled by Integration Agent)

REQUEST:
(empty body)

RESPONSE (Success - 200):
{
  "success": true,
  "orderId": "764426",
  "items": [
    {
      "orderItemId": "6560045",
      "productId": "3074457345619160265",
      "partNumber": "BCL015_150101",
      "productName": "Product Name",
      "quantity": "1.0",
      "unitPrice": "45.00000",
      "orderItemPrice": "45.00000",
      "orderItemInventoryStatus": "Available",
      "shippingCharge": "0.00000",
      "salesTax": "0.00000"
    },
    {
      "orderItemId": "6550001",
      "productId": "3074457345619160060",
      "partNumber": "BCL014_141301",
      "productName": "Another Product",
      "quantity": "1.0",
      "unitPrice": "40.00000",
      "orderItemPrice": "40.00000",
      "orderItemInventoryStatus": "Available",
      "shippingCharge": "0.00000",
      "salesTax": "0.00000"
    }
  ],
  "cartTotals": {
    "itemCount": 2,
    "subtotal": "85.00000",
    "shippingCharge": "0.00000",
    "salesTax": "0.00000",
    "grandTotal": "85.00000",
    "currency": "USD",
    "orderId": "764426"
  }
}

RESPONSE (Error - 401/500):
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "UNAUTHORIZED" | "SERVER_ERROR",
  "message": "Error message"
}
```

#### **Endpoint 3: Remove from Cart**

```
POST /api/hcl/cart/remove
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: (handled by Integration Agent)

REQUEST:
{
  "orderItemId": "6560045"
}

RESPONSE (Success - 200):
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Item removed successfully",
  "cartTotals": {
    "itemCount": 1,
    "subtotal": "40.00000",
    "grandTotal": "40.00000",
    ...
  }
}

RESPONSE (Error):
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "ITEM_NOT_FOUND",
  "message": "Item not found in cart"
}
```

