## 🎨 CSS Structure

### Commerce Mini-Cart Classes

```css
.commerce-mini-cart                    /* Container */
.commerce-mini-cart__toggle            /* Toggle button */
.commerce-mini-cart__icon              /* Cart icon */
.commerce-mini-cart__badge             /* Item count badge */
.commerce-mini-cart__dropdown          /* Dropdown menu */
.commerce-mini-cart__header            /* Header section */
.commerce-mini-cart__items             /* Items container */
.commerce-mini-cart__item              /* Individual item */
.commerce-mini-cart__item-info         /* Item info section */
.commerce-mini-cart__item-name         /* Product name */
.commerce-mini-cart__item-qty          /* Quantity */
.commerce-mini-cart__item-price        /* Price */
.commerce-mini-cart__item-remove       /* Remove button */
.commerce-mini-cart__footer            /* Footer section */
.commerce-mini-cart__totals            /* Totals display */
.commerce-mini-cart__subtotal          /* Subtotal value */
.commerce-mini-cart__total             /* Total value */
.commerce-mini-cart__view-cart-btn     /* View Cart link */
.commerce-mini-cart__checkout-btn      /* Checkout link */
.commerce-mini-cart__empty             /* Empty state */
.commerce-mini-cart__error             /* Error state */
```

