## ⚠️ Known Limitations & Dependencies

### Assumptions
- ✅ Integration Agent has deployed runtime actions
- ✅ API endpoints are available and properly CORS-configured
- ✅ WCToken and WCTrustedToken are managed by Integration Agent
- ✅ Authentication is handled server-side

### Dependencies
- Adobe I/O Runtime actions (Integration Agent's responsibility)
- HCL Commerce API availability
- Network connectivity

### Limitations
- Real-time sync may have slight lag (2-second cache)
- No offline support
- Requires active HCL Commerce session

